<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Therefore do the virgins love Thee:</l><l>Jesus, Jesus, Jesus, Jesus!</l><l>Therefore do the virgins love Thee,</l><l>Therefore do the virgins love Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Thy love is much better than wine:</l><l>Jesus, Jesus, Jesus, Jesus!</l><l>Thy love is much better than wine,</l><l>Thy love is much better than wine.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Draw me, we will run after Thee:</l><l>Jesus, Jesus, Jesus, Jesus!</l><l>Draw me, we will run after Thee,</l><l>Draw me, we will run after Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Behold, Thou art fair, my Beloved:</l><l>Jesus, Jesus, Jesus, Jesus!</l><l>Behold, Thou art fair, my Beloved,</l><l>Behold, Thou art fair, my Beloved.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>I found Him whom my soul doth love:</l><l>Jesus, Jesus, Jesus, Jesus!</l><l>I found Him whom my soul doth love,</l><l>I found Him whom my soul doth love.</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>I held Him and would not let go:</l><l>Jesus, Jesus, Jesus, Jesus!</l><l>I held Him and would not let go,</l><l>I held Him and would not let go.</l></lg>
<lg label="8."><l>Make haste, my Beloved, to come:</l><l>Jesus, Jesus, Jesus, Jesus!</l><l>Make haste, my Beloved, to come,</l><l>Make haste, my Beloved, to come.</l></lg>
<lg label="9."><l>We love Thee with all of our heart:</l><l>Jesus, Jesus, Jesus, Jesus!</l><l>We love Thee with all of our heart,</l><l>We love Thee with all of our heart.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
